---
<Layout title={title} description={description} ogImage={ogImage}>

  <!-- 페이지 히어로 -->
  <section class='relative h-56 md:h-72 overflow-hidden'>
    <img src={`${base}/images/bg-new/gal1.webp`} alt='웨딩마치 스튜디오 메이크업룸' class='w-full h-full object-cover object-center' />
    <div class='absolute inset-0' style='background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(26,16,8,0.5), rgba(26,16,8,0.75));'></div>
    <div class='absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-6'>
      <p class='text-white/60 text-xs tracking-[0.5em] uppercase font-light mb-3'>Services & Pricing</p>
      <h1 class='font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl font-light text-white tracking-wider mb-3'>Packages</h1>
      <div class='w-10 h-px bg-white/40'></div>
      <p class='text-white/70 text-sm font-light mt-3'>드레스부터 당일 서비스까지 원스톱으로</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 시즌 이벤트 모달 -->
  <div id='seasonEventModal' class='season-event-modal hidden' role='dialog' aria-modal='true' aria-hidden='true' aria-labelledby='seasonEventTitle'>
    <div class='season-event-backdrop' data-event-close></div>
    <div class='season-event-frame'>
      <button class='season-event-close' type='button' aria-label='이벤트 창 닫기' data-event-close>×</button>
      <h2 id='seasonEventTitle' class='sr-only'>시즌 한정 특별 이벤트</h2>
      <img class='season-event-banner' src={seasonEvent.image} alt={seasonEvent.alt} loading='eager' decoding='async' />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 카테고리 진입 카드 -->
  <section class='py-20 px-6' style='background: #FAF8F5;'>
    <div class='max-w-6xl mx-auto'>
      <div class='text-center mb-12'>
        <p class='text-xs tracking-[0.5em] text-[#B76E79] uppercase font-light mb-4'>Transparent Pricing</p>
        <h2 class='font-display text-4xl font-light text-gray-900 mb-4'>가격 안내</h2>
        <div class='w-12 h-px bg-[#B76E79] mx-auto mb-5'></div>
        <p class='text-sm text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto'>
          스드메 패키지는 <strong class='font-normal text-gray-700'>제휴 스튜디오 선택</strong>에 따라 구성됩니다.
          공정거래위원회 「결혼서비스 가격표시제」에 따라 카테고리별 기본가·선택 품목·환불 기준을 모두 공개합니다.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='mb-10 border border-[#D4A0A7] bg-white'>
        <div class='grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1.9fr]'>
          <div class='p-8 md:p-10' style='background:#1a1008;'>
            <p class='text-xs tracking-[0.4em] uppercase font-light mb-4' style='color:#D4A0A7;'>Fixed Price</p>
            <h3 class='font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-white mb-4'>대표 정찰 금액</h3>
            <p class='text-sm text-white/60 font-light leading-relaxed'>
              상담 전 바로 확인할 수 있는 기본 기준가입니다. 모든 금액은 제휴 또는 이벤트에 따라 진행 금액이 상이할 수 있습니다.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class='divide-y divide-[#E8DDD5]'>
            {fixedPriceRows.map((row) => (
              <div class='grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-2 px-6 py-5 sm:items-center'>
                <div>
                  <p class='text-sm text-gray-900 font-normal'>{row.item}</p>
                  <p class='text-xs text-gray-500 font-light mt-1'>{row.detail}</p>
                </div>
                <p class='font-display text-2xl text-[#B76E79] font-light sm:text-right'>{row.price}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8'>
        {categories.map((cat) => (
          <a href={`#${cat.anchor}`} class='group flex flex-col h-full border border-[#E8DDD5] bg-white p-8 md:p-9 hover:border-[#B76E79] transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl'>
            <div class='mb-6 pb-5 border-b border-[#E8DDD5]'>
